cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SENSEI, please cite the archived software release below."
type: software
title: "SENSEI: software for model calibration and state estimation in water distribution networks"
abstract: >-
  Three Windows tools for model calibration and state estimation in water
  distribution networks modelled with EPANET: multi-period calibration,
  pseudo-dynamic (multiperiod) state estimation and snapshot state estimation.
  All solve the same weighted least-squares problem under different partitions
  of the unknowns, using EPANET as the hydraulic oracle, and return posterior
  covariances and normalised residuals.
